{
  "_comment": "Purpose: Sensitive Data Protection (Cloud DLP) InspectTemplate identifying banking PII infoTypes in MCP tool responses. Architecture/Context: Referenced by gateway/model_armor/ma-template.json.tmpl; stripped of _comment and upserted via dlp.googleapis.com/v2. Dependencies/Side Effects: Requires dlp.googleapis.com enabled. Author: Pradeep Singh | License: Apache-2.0",
